<view class="page"><view class="row"><text class="eyebrow">CAMPUSPILOT / 校园智办</text><text class="badge">演示校园</text></view><view class="heading">校园大小事，
交给清晰的下一步。</view><view class="muted">AI 理解需求 · 整理材料 · 跟进办理</view><view class="hero card" bindtap="ask"><view class="hero-glow"/><image class="campus" src="/assets/campus-hero.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><text class="eyebrow">YOUR CAMPUS AGENT</text><view class="hero-title">说说你要办什么</view><view class="muted">从一个问题，到一份可执行的计划。</view><button class="gap">开启智能办理 ↗</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card"><text class="error">{{error}}</text><button class="secondary gap" bindtap="retry">重新连接</button></view><view class="section-title">校园服务</view><view class="services"><view wx:for="{{services}}" wx:key="id" class="service-card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openService"><text class="badge">0{{index+1}} / {{item.category}}</text><view class="service-name">{{item.title}} ↗</view><view class="muted small">{{item.description}}</view></view></view><view class="row gap"><text class="section-title">最近办理</text><text class="inline-link" bindtap="tasks">全部任务 →</text></view><view wx:if="{{!tasks.length}}" class="card empty"><text class="muted">还没有办理记录，先向助手说说需求吧。</text></view><view wx:for="{{tasks}}" wx:key="id" class="card" bindtap="tasks"><view class="row"><text>{{item.title}}</text><text class="badge">{{item.progress}}%</text></view><view class="progress"><view class="progress-fill" style="width:{{item.progress}}%"/></view><text class="muted small">{{item.status}}</text></view><view class="notice">当前知识和校园信息为演示资料；正式办理请以学校通知为准。</view></view>